<body class="wp-singular page-template page-template-elementor_canvas page page-id-227 wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-twentytwentyfive elementor-default elementor-template-canvas elementor-kit-4 elementor-page elementor-page-227">
			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="227" class="elementor elementor-227">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00000 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00000-s " data-id="e00000" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00000">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00004 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00004-s " data-id="e00004" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00004">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">THE UNDERTOW</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00006-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00006">Issue 34 · Six investigations a year · Member-funded since 2020</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00009 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00009-s " data-id="e00009" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00009">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000a-s " data-id="e0000a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b">INVESTIGATIVE MAGAZINE · EST. 2020</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e0000c" class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-heading-base">Six stories a year. Each one took a year.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d">The Undertow is funded by 11,400 members and nobody else. No advertising, no proprietor, no sponsored anything. We publish when the reporting is done, which is sometimes fourteen months late.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000f"><a href="#membership" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Become a member
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g"><a href="#index" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Read the index
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000h-s " data-id="e0000h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000h">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0000i-s" data-interaction-id="e0000i" id="225" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-the-undertow-documents.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-the-undertow-documents.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-the-undertow-documents-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-the-undertow-documents-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Stacked pages of disclosed documents, annotated and tagged"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000j-s " data-id="e0000j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000j">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000k">PUBLISHED THURSDAY · CURRENT</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000l" class="e-ykrhga-e0000l-s e-heading-base">The Dry County</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">How a water utility sold the same aquifer twice, and the eleven families who noticed. Eight months of reporting, 240 pages of documents, published Thursday.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000n-s " data-id="e0000n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000n">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000o e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0000o-s " data-id="e0000o" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000p-s " data-id="e0000p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000q">8</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r">MONTHS</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000s-s " data-id="e0000s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000t">240</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">DOCUMENTS</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000v-s " data-id="e0000v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000w">11</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000x">FAMILIES</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y" id="index">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000z-s " data-id="e0000z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00010 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00010-s " data-id="e00010" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00010">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00011 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00011-s " data-id="e00011" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00011">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00012-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00012">THE INDEX</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00013" class="e-ykrhga-e00013-s e-heading-base">The last twelve pieces</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00014-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00014">Two years of work, in order. Every one of them is still online, with its documents, its costings and its corrections attached.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00015 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00015-s " data-id="e00015" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00015">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00016 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00016-s " data-id="e00016" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00016">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00017 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00017-s " data-id="e00017" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00017">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00018 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00018-s " data-id="e00018" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00018">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00019-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00019">14.03.26</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001a-s " data-id="e0001a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001a">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001b" class="e-ykrhga-e0001b-s e-heading-base">THE QUOTA THAT WASN’T</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001c">By Elena Mbeki</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001d-s " data-id="e0001d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001d">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001e">Fisheries</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001f">11 months</p>
		
</div>

