<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004k-s " data-id="e0004k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004m e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0004m-s " data-id="e0004m" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004n-s " data-id="e0004n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004o">THE COSTINGS</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004p" class="e-ykrhga-e0004p-s e-heading-base">What a year of reporting actually costs</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004q">A full investigation costs us between 60,000 and 90,000. Roughly a third of that is legal review. We publish that breakdown for every piece.</p>
					<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0004r-s" data-interaction-id="e0004r" id="226" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-the-undertow-reporter_field.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-the-undertow-reporter_field.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-the-undertow-reporter_field-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-the-undertow-reporter_field-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="A reporter working in the field, notebook in hand"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004s-s " data-id="e0004s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004t-s " data-id="e0004t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004u-s " data-id="e0004u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004u">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004v e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0004v-s " data-id="e0004v" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004x">Reporter time, nine to fourteen months</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004y">One reporter, sometimes two, off everything else.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004z">£34,000</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00051 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00051-s " data-id="e00051" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00051">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00054-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00054">Legal review, pre-publication</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">Read line by line before anyone else sees a word.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00056-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00056">£22,000</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00057 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00057-s " data-id="e00057" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00057">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00059 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00059-s " data-id="e00059" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00059">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005a-s " data-id="e0005a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Documents, FOI and court fees</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005c">240 pages on the current piece. We paid for all of them.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">£6,400</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005g e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005g-s " data-id="e0005g" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005h-s " data-id="e0005h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">Travel, fixers and lodging</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005j">Eleven families do not live in one place.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005k">£5,200</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005l-s " data-id="e0005l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005m-s " data-id="e0005m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005m">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005o-s " data-id="e0005o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">Fact-checking, independent second pass</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q">A checker who did not write it and is paid to disagree.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">£4,800</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005s-s " data-id="e0005s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005t-s " data-id="e0005t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005t">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005u e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005u-s " data-id="e0005u" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005v-s " data-id="e0005v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005w">Translation and transcription</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005x">Ninety hours of tape, typed by humans.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005y">£2,600</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00060 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00060-s " data-id="e00060" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00060">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">TYPICAL TOTAL, ONE INVESTIGATION</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00062-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00062">£75,000</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00063-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00063">Six pieces a year. 11,400 members. The arithmetic is not comfortable, which is why we print it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00065 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00065-s " data-id="e00065" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00065">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00066 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00066-s " data-id="e00066" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00066">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00067 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00067-s " data-id="e00067" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00067">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00068 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00068-s " data-id="e00068" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00068">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00069 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00069-s " data-id="e00069" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00069">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006a">CORRECTIONS · 23 SINCE 2020</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006b" class="e-ykrhga-e0006b-s e-heading-base">Everything we got wrong is still here</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006c">We have issued 23 corrections in six years and every one is still on the site with the original text struck through, not deleted.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006d"><a href="#corrections-ledger" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Read the corrections page
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006e-s " data-id="e0006e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006e" id="corrections-ledger">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006f-s " data-id="e0006f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006g-s " data-id="e0006g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006h">OWNERSHIP</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006i" class="e-ykrhga-e0006i-s e-heading-base">Who owns us, and who does not</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006j">The Undertow is owned by a trust with a locked purpose clause. It cannot be sold, and no member owns more than one vote.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006k e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0006k-s " data-id="e0006k" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006l-s " data-id="e0006l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006m-s " data-id="e0006m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006n">WHO OWNS US</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006o-s " data-id="e0006o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006p-s " data-id="e0006p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006p">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006q" class="e-ykrhga-e0006q-s e-heading-base">The Undertow Trust</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006r">Holds the title. A locked purpose clause: it cannot be sold, merged or floated.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006s-s " data-id="e0006s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006t-s " data-id="e0006t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006t">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006u" class="e-ykrhga-e0006u-s e-heading-base">11,400 members</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006v">One vote each. Nobody gets two, including the editor.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006w-s " data-id="e0006w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006x-s " data-id="e0006x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006x">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006y" class="e-ykrhga-e0006y-s e-heading-base">The reporters</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006z">Copyright reverts to them after five years. Always has.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00070 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00070-s " data-id="e00070" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00070">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00071 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00071-s " data-id="e00071" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00071">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00072-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00072">WHO DOES NOT</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00073 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00073-s " data-id="e00073" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00073">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00074 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00074-s " data-id="e00074" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00074">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00075" class="e-ykrhga-e00075-s e-heading-base">No advertiser</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00076-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00076">We have never sold a page, a slot or a newsletter line.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00077 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00077-s " data-id="e00077" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00077">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00078 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00078-s " data-id="e00078" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00078">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00079" class="e-ykrhga-e00079-s e-heading-base">No proprietor</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007a">There is no owner to ring on a Sunday night.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007b-s " data-id="e0007b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007b">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007c-s " data-id="e0007c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007c">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007d" class="e-ykrhga-e0007d-s e-heading-base">No venture fund</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007e">No growth round, so no growth reason to publish faster.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007f-s " data-id="e0007f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007g-s " data-id="e0007g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007g">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007h" class="e-ykrhga-e0007h-s e-heading-base">No party, no state</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007i">We take nothing from either, and we publish what we are offered.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007j-s " data-id="e0007j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007k-s " data-id="e0007k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007l-s " data-id="e0007l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007m-s " data-id="e0007m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007n">LETTERS</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0007o" class="e-ykrhga-e0007o-s e-heading-base">Three readers, unedited</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007p">Printed as received, including the punctuation and the parts that sting.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007q-s " data-id="e0007q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007q">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007r e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007r-s " data-id="e0007r" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007s-s " data-id="e0007s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007t">“</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007u">I disagreed with almost everything in the fisheries piece and I renewed anyway, because you printed the reply from the man you accused, in full, on the same page.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007v-s " data-id="e0007v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007v">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007w-s " data-id="e0007w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007x">R.H., Aberdeen</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007y">Renewed February 2026</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007z-s " data-id="e0007z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00080-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00080">“</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00081-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00081">I read the housing piece on a Tuesday and by Friday my landlord had a letter from the council. I do not think those two things are related. I have decided to believe they are.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00082 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00082-s " data-id="e00082" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00082">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00083 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00083-s " data-id="e00083" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00083">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00084-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00084">M.O., Salford</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00085-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00085">Member since 2023</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00086 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00086-s " data-id="e00086" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00086">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00087-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00087">“</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00088-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00088">Cancel my membership. Then, twelve days later, put it back. I was wrong about the pension piece. You were slower than I wanted and righter than I expected.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00089 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00089-s " data-id="e00089" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00089">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008a-s " data-id="e0008a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008b">J.T., Belfast</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008c">Both emails printed, unedited</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008d-s " data-id="e0008d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008d" id="membership">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008e-s " data-id="e0008e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008f-s " data-id="e0008f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008g">MEMBERSHIP</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0008h" class="e-ykrhga-e0008h-s e-heading-base">£8 a month, or £80 a year</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008i">Students and anyone out of work pay £3 and we do not ask for proof. Membership is the only ask on this page, because it is the only income we have.</p>
		
</div>
