    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008n">£3</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008o">a month</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008p">Students and anyone out of work. We do not ask for proof and we never will.</p>
